00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.720 size:51% position:26% line:94%
 -Ils se parlent. 
 
<c.yellow> -En quelle langue ? </c>

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.200 line:94%
 -En français et ils se comprennent. 
 
<c.yellow> -D'accord.</c>

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.680 line:95%
 J'aurai gagné mon combat 

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:50.160 line:95%
 pour la culture bretonne, 
 le jour où... 

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:53.360 size:61% position:30% line:95%
 -Le jour où on proposera
 l'enseignement du breton

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.200 line:95%
